message: If you use this artifact, please cite the DireLeak paper.
title: DireLeak MICRO 2026 artifact
abstract: >-
  Reverse-engineers the geometry and allocation policy of the Intel memory
  directory (MD/HitME) cache and builds two attacks on it: a cross-domain
  covert channel and an ML-model fingerprinting side channel.
